@AiReap.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5299

### Register (self-service role selection — Phase 0 demo convenience only)
POST {{AiReap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ba@aireap.dev",
  "password": "Passw0rd!23",
  "displayName": "BA Tester",
  "role": "BusinessAnalyst"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{AiReap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ba@aireap.dev",
  "password": "Passw0rd!23"
}

### List projects
GET {{AiReap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create project
POST {{AiReap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Complaint Management",
  "description": "Employees submit complaints, managers investigate them."
}

### AI demo round trip (replace projectId with one from the create/list response above)
POST {{AiReap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/aidemo/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "rawText": "We need a complaint management application where employees can submit complaints and managers investigate them."
}

